WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.968
"Waldo!" Ben cried. "Look out!"

2
00:00:03.969 --> 00:00:11.982
"Huh?" Waldo saw the egg coming and managed to duck in the nick of time.

3
00:00:11.983 --> 00:00:16.115
Ben didn't move, expecting the egg to pass right through him.

4
00:00:16.116 --> 00:00:17.980
But—

5
00:00:17.981 --> 00:00:24.379
splat! The dodo egg hit Ben in the chest, and gooey green dodo yolk splattered all over

6
00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:27.221
him. "Ugh." Ben looked down at his

7
00:00:27.222 --> 00:00:30.997
shirt. "What a mess. Why didn't the egg go right through

8
00:00:30.998 --> 00:00:33.755
me?" Loud laughter suddenly rang

9
00:00:33.756 --> 00:00:40.189
out. A few of the monsters from Team Orange had come into the

10
00:00:40.190 --> 00:00:46.330
gym. "Nice catch, ghost boy!" Carly called. Carly was a

11
00:00:46.331 --> 00:00:54.423
doppelganger. A witch named Brunhilda was cackling with

12
00:00:54.424 --> 00:00:57.510
delight. "You've got egg on your face,

13
00:00:57.511 --> 00:00:59.486
Ben!" Winnie hurried over to

14
00:00:59.487 --> 00:01:06.643
him. "Are you all right?" She held a hand over her mouth, as if she was trying hard not to laugh

15
00:01:06.644 --> 00:01:11.396
too. "I'm fine." Ben wiped egg off his

16
00:01:11.397 --> 00:01:14.184
shirt. "Sorry about that, Ben," Waldo

17
00:01:14.185 --> 00:01:17.333
said. "I tried to cast a spell to stop the egg,

18
00:01:17.334 --> 00:01:22.560
but—" Mog frowned. "No magic during Field Day events,

19
00:01:22.561 --> 00:01:25.426
Waldo. So you can't use it during practice,

20
00:01:25.427 --> 00:01:28.675
either." Waldo nodded.

21
00:01:28.676 --> 00:01:31.816
"Right!" Zork and his teammates were still

22
00:01:31.817 --> 00:01:34.930
laughing. "No offense, Team Black," Zork

23
00:01:34.931 --> 00:01:41.534
said. "But if that's the best you can do, Team Orange is headed for an easy victory."

24
00:01:41.535 --> 00:01:46.421
"Maybe you guys should just sit in the stands and . . ." Carly made her eyes pop out.

25
00:01:46.422 --> 00:01:50.255
"Watch the events instead of competing in them."

26
00:01:50.256 --> 00:01:55.029
Deb, who was the only doppelganger on Mog's team, shot back.

27
00:01:55.030 --> 00:01:57.771
"Well, watch out, Team Orange.

28
00:01:57.772 --> 00:02:00.525
Because tomorrow we're going to bury you!"

29
00:02:00.526 --> 00:02:06.517
She changed into a big tombstone that read RIP Team Orange.

30
00:02:06.518 --> 00:02:15.556
The two doppelgangers kept dueling while everyone in the gym watched.

31
00:02:15.557 --> 00:02:18.629
Carly turned into a giant worm.

32
00:02:18.630 --> 00:02:23.384
"You're the ones who will be sleeping with the worms when we're through with you!"

33
00:02:23.385 --> 00:02:27.652
"Even a worm could outrun you slugs."

34
00:02:27.653 --> 00:02:35.684
Deb became a giant slug and slithered around the gym, leaving a trail of slime.

35
00:02:35.685 --> 00:02:38.816
Serena turned to Winnie.

36
00:02:38.817 --> 00:02:42.019
"This is getting boring," she murmured.

37
00:02:42.020 --> 00:02:50.930
"Let's go." Heads turned to watch Serena walk toward the exit.

38
00:02:50.931 --> 00:02:54.480
Winnie rushed after her.

39
00:02:54.481 --> 00:02:58.191
Zork stepped into the middle of the gym.

40
00:02:58.192 --> 00:03:01.631
"Huddle up, Team Orange," he called.

41
00:03:01.632 --> 00:03:07.429
"Let's show these Team Black losers how a real team practices."

42
00:03:07.430 --> 00:03:14.470
Carly and Brunhilda joined him, along with Cleo and a werewolf named Lon.

43
00:03:14.471 --> 00:03:20.024
Ben quickly counted the competitors.

44
00:03:20.025 --> 00:03:23.528
"That's only five monsters," he thought.

45
00:03:23.529 --> 00:03:26.831
"I wonder who the sixth member of their team is."

46
00:03:26.832 --> 00:03:31.744
Mog scowled. "That's enough practice for now, Team Black.

47
00:03:31.745 --> 00:03:33.012
Let's get out of here.

48
00:03:33.013 --> 00:03:36.752
We don't want to give these jokers any tips for winning."

49
00:03:36.753 --> 00:03:39.532
They headed for the exit too.

50
00:03:39.533 --> 00:03:44.311
"Don't drop any more eggs on your way out!" Carly called after them.

51
00:03:44.312 --> 00:03:48.049
"Yeah," Lon said. "You guys already stink!"

52
00:03:48.050 --> 00:03:57.838
Zork laughed. "I'm looking forward to seeing you tomorrow—especially at our first event, the tug-of-war.

53
00:03:57.839 --> 00:04:05.775
That's when you'll get a look at our secret weapon!"

54
00:04:05.776 --> 00:04:21.063
Mog gulped and looked at Ben. "Did he just say secret weapon?"

55
00:04:21.064 --> 00:04:26.001
*** The next morning Ben found his teammates on the field behind the

56
00:04:26.002 --> 00:04:30.050
school. They were all dressed in

57
00:04:30.051 --> 00:04:35.045
black. "Welcome to Field Day!" Mr. Freaky

58
00:04:35.046 --> 00:04:41.232
called. Like the teachers, he was dressed in orange and black so he could root for both

59
00:04:41.233 --> 00:04:50.112
teams. The cheerleaders waved their pom-poms. "Go, Orange! Go, Black!" they

60
00:04:50.113 --> 00:04:54.104
cheered. Mr. Gwarg blew his

61
00:04:54.105 --> 00:04:57.613
whistle. "Okay, monsters, here's how Field Day

62
00:04:57.614 --> 00:05:08.972
works. We've got four events today—the tug-of-war, the sack race, the slime ball toss, and finally, the cross-country

63
00:05:08.973 --> 00:05:14.793
race. The team that wins the most events will be crowned Field Day champions."

64
00:05:14.794 --> 00:05:19.701
"Woo-hoo! That's going to be us!" Zork shouted.

65
00:05:19.702 --> 00:05:25.794
"Mr. Gwarg?" Francis hopped up and down, trying to get the gym teacher's attention.

66
00:05:25.795 --> 00:05:31.443
Finally the gym teacher saw him. "Yes, Francis?"

67
00:05:31.444 --> 00:05:35.736
"What happens if there's a tie?" Francis asked.

68
00:05:35.737 --> 00:05:40.321
"Huh." Mr. Gwarg tapped a finger against his chin.

69
00:05:40.322 --> 00:05:43.023
"I never thought about that before."

70
00:05:43.024 --> 00:05:47.199
He was quiet for a few seconds.

71
00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:57.996
"Well, how about this: If there's a tie, the team with the second-place winner in the cross-country race will win."

72
00:05:57.997 --> 00:06:01.096
A zombie wiped drool from his chin.

73
00:06:01.097 --> 00:06:05.378
"That doesn't make much sense," he said.

74
00:06:05.379 --> 00:06:09.153
He looked around at some other monsters.

75
00:06:09.154 --> 00:06:15.035
"Or does it?" Another bit of drool dripped from his mouth.

76
00:06:15.036 --> 00:06:18.142
"It doesn't matter if it makes sense!" Lon said.

77
00:06:18.143 --> 00:06:26.902
"Because Team Orange is going to win every single event!" He howled loudly.

78
00:06:26.903 --> 00:06:31.483
Deb narrowed her eyes. "No way, hairball!"

79
00:06:31.484 --> 00:06:42.233
Monsters booed and cheered again.

80
00:06:42.234 --> 00:06:47.073
They were so loud that some monsters held their hands over their ears.

81
00:06:47.074 --> 00:06:53.425
A monster with four ears but only two hands tried desperately to cover her ears.

82
00:06:53.426 --> 00:07:05.203
Ben sighed. Field Day hadn't even started yet, and he already felt exhausted.

